        "base_expression": "The base loss is $f(\\widehat x)-f(x_*)$. For a fixed horizon, the minimax risk is $$\\mathcal E_T^{(p)}=\\inf_A\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal F_{S_p}(d,\\mu,\\rho,R)}\\mathbb E[f(\\widehat x)-f(x_*)].$$ Expectation includes private randomization and observation noise.",
